{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Detect hidden warships on the map, reach the target score with limited resources, and empower every move with strategic cards! This single-player strategy and discovery game offers a unique RPG experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854370/extras/dab486bfd516e50504e276fc93a7a3a6.poster.avif?t=1751967088\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854370/extras/dab486bfd516e50504e276fc93a7a3a6.webp?t=1751967088\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cards with Distinct Abilities :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck to overcome challenging levels. Create unique strategies for each stage using a variety of powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854370/extras/d295b64ed75efb1ae248b0d0a6084f2e.avif?t=1751967088\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different Challenges :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of challenges in each level that push you to adapt your strategy and think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sharpen your aim, trust your deck, and sail toward victory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What\u2019s in this demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf 18 playable levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf 24 different cards to use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf 5 types of challenges you may encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Endless replayability \u2013 play as many times as you want</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Save anytime and continue later from where you